g bridges for the 9th Division’s drive across France. It helped enable the first US crossing of the Seine and joined brutal fighting in the Battle of Hürtgen Forest and the Battle of the Bulge. In March 1945, Company B earned a Distinguished Unit Citation for its role in the crossing at Remagen, where the battalion helped secure the Ludendorff Bridge and push deeper into Germany. The unit remained active until late 1946, after having supported every major 9th Division campaign in Europe."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Homefront","hasDeployment":true,"historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/15th_ENGINEERS.15th_ENGINEERS","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_15th_engineers_photo","SourceString":"US Combat engineers dragging an assault boat in preparation of a river crossing in Germany, 1945.","LocalizedString":"US Combat engineers dragging an assault boat in preparation of a river crossing in Germany, 1945."},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_ExplosionInfantryL'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Niagara/NS_ExplosionInfantryL.47"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeHeavy_C'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/examples/GrenadePack/Blueprints/CameraShakeHeavy.0"},"OnAttackVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/Infantry/BP_AttackInfantry.BP_AttackInfantry_C","SubPathString":""},"isDirectDamage":true},"variables":[{"name":"frontCount","type":"int32","direction":"in"}],"functions":[{"name":"ExecuteUbergraph_card_unit_15th_engineers","owner":"card_unit_15th_engineers_C","params":[{"name":"EntryPoint","type":"int32","direction":"in"}],"pure":false,"event":false,"flags":"FUNC_Final | FUNC_UbergraphFunction | FUNC_HasDefaults","locals":[{"name":"CallFunc_Greater_IntInt_ReturnValue","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"Temp_int_Array_Index_Variable","type":"int32","direction":"in"},{